<p>I'm still unclear about the whole, &quot;abstract concept humanity&quot; thing. I don't see why they wouldn't just assume this thing/area/ship, makes you think things are human when they are not. Much like the one scip that makes people think lamps are people.</p>
<p>It's a really thick read for me personally, and I have to go back through it several times to get what is being said/described.</p>
